---
description: Bind each member's preferences, availability and accessibility needs to the latest explicit agreement.
args: { garden: GardenDossier; change: GardenChange }
returns: GardenPreference[]
---
Keep desired use, volunteer availability, and access needs as separately attributed statements. Compare new member responses with current agreements and preserve any disagreement; a preference is not consent to perform work. An unavailable member's duties remain unassigned until affected members accept a revised agreement.
